51897.0 gpu: world lighting-control control=bump kind=pass-switch state=refused declared=50 visible=46 resolved=50 missing=0 materials=46 triangles=32769 requested=0 effective=0 parsed=1 first=CP_SUNSHINE/NATURE/BLENDROCKTOGRASS001 resource=materials/nature/rockwall009_height-ssbump.vtf reason=off: the world pass has one bump sampler slot (--world-bump) and the per-material path is off too (--world-material-bump), so the 46 visible materials that name one of 23 distinct $bumpmap textures are drawn with no normal map at all
